---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Premium Domain Valuation Guide | Premium Domain for Sale | Desert Rich"
  description="Learn how to value premium domain names like LaPlayaEsVida.com — comps, brandability, TLD strength, and acquisition pricing for investment domains."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="pt-28 pb-20">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 prose-domain">
      <p class="section-kicker mb-3">Guide</p>
      <h1 class="heading-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-[var(--text)] mb-4">How to value a premium lifestyle domain</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[var(--text-muted)] mb-8">
        Buyers searching for premium domain names, investment domains, and expired or brandable assets need a clear framework. Here is how sophisticated buyers evaluate an exact-phrase .com like LaPlayaEsVida.com.
      </p>

      <section class="space-y-4 text-[var(--text-muted)] text-base mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">1. Exact match and memorability</h2>
        <p>
          Domains that mirror a spoken phrase (“La playa es vida”) outperform invented strings. Hyphen-free, short, and bilingual pronunciation increase type-in traffic and brand recall.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">2. Market TAM attachment</h2>
        <p>
          Attach the domain to a real commercial market — beach tourism, coastal real estate, hospitality, fashion. Larger addressable markets support higher acquisition premiums.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">3. Comparable sales</h2>
        <p>
          Review NameBio and industry reports for Spanish lifestyle and travel .coms. Exact cultural phrases with emotional pull routinely clear five-figure to mid-six-figure transfers when paired with clear end-user use.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--text)]">4. Transfer risk and liquidity</h2>
        <p>
          Escrow-ready sellers, clean WHOIS/history, and .com TLD liquidity reduce friction — and that liquidity is priced into serious offers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <aside class="surface-card rounded-3xl p-6 mb-8">
        <p class="text-[var(--text)] font-semibold mb-2">Applied example</p>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">
          LaPlayaEsVida.com is listed at $75,000 as a premium Spanish lifestyle .com for sale — an exact phrase with global Spanish reach and clear end-user verticals.
        </p>
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex mt-4 text-[var(--accent)] underline underline-offset-4">View the listing</a>
      </aside>

      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]">
        <a href="/guides/" class="underline underline-offset-4">All guides</a>
        <a href="/guides/beach-lifestyle-market/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Market trends</a>
        <a href="/guides/success-stories/" class="underline underline-offset-4">Success stories</a>
      </nav>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
